# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/.terraformrc
**/terraform.rc
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info

# Ansible
**/retry-files/
**/*.retry
**/inventory/*
!**/inventory/*.example
!**/inventory/test/
!**/inventory/prod/
# The two negations above only re-include the directory entries themselves -
# without the two lines below, files placed inside them (real hosts.yml with
# real IPs/credentials) are NOT actually excluded and can be committed by
# accident. Keep only .gitkeep tracked; everything else in these two
# directories stays local-only.
**/inventory/prod/*
**/inventory/test/*
!**/inventory/prod/.gitkeep
!**/inventory/test/.gitkeep
**/vault-password.txt
**/.vault_pass

# Sensitive data
**/*secrets*
**/*password*
**/*credentials*
**/.env
**/.env.local
!**/.env.example

# IDE
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/

# Backup files
**/*.bak
**/*backup*
**/.*.bak

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.claude/
